{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1007278037"}, "name":{"label":"UserDay1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-05T12:58:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"9475218600"}, "title":{"label":"Super effective!"}, "content":{"label":"This app is amazing, within a week of downloading it I cut my screen time by half. \n\nThe pro version is very cheap and enables me to customise the waiting time to use my apps so it’s more effective at preventing me from procrastinating.\n\nAlso the app is effective at preventing you from reversing the restrictions you’ve put on yourself (which was great for me since I constantly unlock apples time limit 😅).\n\nOverall, I’m way more mindful of the way I use my apps because I no longer get instant gratification from it anymore. I would recommend this to students who tend to procrastinate on their phone and anyone who is trying to get rid of their phone addiction.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
