{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1026954018"}, "name":{"label":"Nightshade99"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-06T02:21:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"9366343869"}, "title":{"label":"Really really good"}, "content":{"label":"This app is really really amazing and I’m glad it exists. It is already helping me to reduce certain compulsions to open certain apps, and prevents me from staying on each app too long.\n\nThere are some bugs or potential features though:\n\n- “I don’t want to open this app” could pop out a bit earlier or maybe immediately so we can cancel right away. I know we can just navigate away from the app though but this would be a nice feature.\n- PIP intentions don’t seem to show up for apps, only for Safari. Not sure why, am I doing something wrong or is this a known bug?\n- video previews of the interventions (or an in-app simulation of the intervention)\n- ensure that all interventions support features like Healthy alternatives. Eg I think that the circle tracing one doesn’t support this feature of Healthy alternatives. Along with this, some documentation such as a matrix of interventions and features, with checks/crosses, would be nice.\n- morning countdown could work for other apps than just the delayed apps. Eg I don’t want to make it hard for me to use Telegram or WhatsApp but I may want to stop myself from using them in the morning when I wake up (I have friends in the East so they send me messages while I’m asleep so there is lots of temptation to reply to them when I wake up). But they shouldn’t be intervened any other time of the day.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id497876698"}, "name":{"label":"ZosiaZ"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-06T01:58:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"9366289677"}, "title":{"label":"Almost perfect"}, "content":{"label":"I really want to give 5 stars because the app is great at what it does, but unfortunately you can’t set up an intervention for any app on your phone. It’s only a list pre-selected by the developer. It has all the social media but personally i get distracted by this game “cooking madness” all the time and I would love to be able to set up an intervention for it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id972616928"}, "name":{"label":"🐾🎀🪽"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-04T10:14:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"9360692639"}, "title":{"label":"Overall happy ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️"}, "content":{"label":"As a young person, social media is something constant and I have been scolded by many because of how much time I as in my devices. This app has helped me cut down on social media almost 100% and I maybe open it once a month!!  It has helped so much :)\n\nA few things though-\n\n1. There is so much you have to pay for and I understand that app developers need the money, but maybe there should be slightly more in the free version?\n\n2. Can you add in an option for games as well? I know that this app was originally made to cut down on social media but it would help me even more for games as I find myself opening them more often now.\n\n3. In the first few weeks, I kept disabling the automation on shortcuts because it annoyed me so much! Maybe you could consider something to stop people doing that?\n\nOverall I am very pleased with this app! \n\nThank you for reading. Enjoy your day ☺️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
